WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.630
Kaiba vs The 8th Duelist

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:27.630
Mai...

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.640
Mai...

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.140
I'll make Marik pay!

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:39.880
It's time for the fourth match.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.880
Jonouchi...

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.380
Big brother...

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.800
You need to watch the duel to prepare for your next match.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.440
I'll take care of Mai.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.130
Shizuka...

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:59.130
Your encouragement helped when I had my eye operation.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.120
Mai is fighting alone.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:07.140
I don't know if I'll be of any help, but I want to stay by her side.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:08.820
You...

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.180
I'll take care of Mai.

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:19.420
You have to focus on dueling to keep moving forward.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:21.910
Mai would say the same thing.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:30.700
Mai, Honda, Otogi...  You all gave me the courage to remove my bandages.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:36.710
I don't know how to duel, but there are other things I can do.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:38.970
Shizuka...

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.070
Shizuka, look after Mai.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:00.480
Marik's Ra card...

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.040
What does its text say?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.280
Big brother.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.710
Mokuba.  Learn anything?

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.530
Sorry.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:13.900
I'm fully utilizing Kaiba Corporation's computer network.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:17.510
But it'll take more time to analyze the data.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:21.950
I'll try accessing Industrial Illusions' host computer.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.180
Contact me when your analysis is complete.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.240
Right!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.420
The fourth match will now begin!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.000
Kaiba...

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.180
Watch, Yugi.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:45.200
The God Card and the title of Duel King is at stake.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:50.640
I promise to win this match so that I can battle you!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.130
Kaiba is more fired up than usual.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.130
His engine is at full throttle.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:08.130
I'll see what the tournament organizer can do.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.000
The mystery duelist hasn't shown up yet.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.140
I'll crush my opponent, no matter who it is!

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.150
My opponent is finally here.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.570
The fourth match!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.880
Seto Kaiba vs...

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.660
The opponent is...

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:40.840
You're late!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.630
You have some nerve making me wait.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:49.580
Or if you're too scared to duel me, I'll let you surrender.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.440
She's...

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.180
You're...

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.180
Duelist #8, what's your name?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.880
My name is Ishizu.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.690
Ishizu Ishtar.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.760
Sis!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.420
Stay back!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:17.660
Yugi, didn't we meet her at the Egyptian exhibit?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:18.930
Yeah.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.360
Who are you?

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.300
I am Ishizu Ishtar.

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:31.770
For 3,000 years, my family has guarded a portion of the Pharaoh's memories.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:35.980
Why are you here?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.580
My destiny led me here.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.820
Explain more clearly.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.820
I didn't expect you to show up.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.640
He's my younger brother.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:52.560
Actually, he's a vessel of sadness, overtaken by his other personality.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:58.070
I will win this duel to save my brother.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.160
Come to think of it, Marik's last name is also Ishtar.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.940
They're siblings.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.610
There's a story behind this.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:11.110
Marik, I will save you.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:14.370
Sis!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.620
Stay back, weakling!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.630
Seto...

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:29.020
This Millennium Necklace has the power to see the future.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.640
You will lose against me.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.970
You cannot avoid this fate.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.170
The future, huh?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.350
So that's another occult item.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.150
I'm tired of your nonsense!

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:51.950
You gave me Obelisk at the museum and asked me to defeat the Ghouls.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:57.260
That's why I started this tournament.  But you're participating too?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.800
What?

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.270
Kaiba and that girl are in cahoots?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.270
You're going to defeat me?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:09.770
How shrewd.  I like you more than our first meeting.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:18.280
The Ghouls attack duelists and manipulates the world, and my brother Marik is their leader.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.280
What?

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.290
But that's not Marik over there.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.790
Sister, are you revealing our secrets?

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:35.370
As the leader of the Ghouls, he can't be forgiven for stealing rare cards.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:39.540
But a bigger menace resides within Marik.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.000
I see.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:48.910
That's why you talked me into holding this tournament.  To lure the Ghouls.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:56.420
I must win to eliminate the personality that is trying to take over my brother.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.510
I see that you're determined.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:02.260
But I don't like the fact that you used me.

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.930
And that you think you can defeat me!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:09.430
I don't know what he means to you.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.920
But I will crush you!

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.350
You said you could see the future.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:21.730
Too bad, Ishizu.  Your occult items don't work against me.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.050
I'll use my cards to create my own future!

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:28.020
Including the one you gave me: Obelisk!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:33.520
But what if the Obelisk in your deck leads to your defeat?

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.930
Start the duel, Isono!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:37.760
Y-Yes sir!

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.840
Start the duel!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.640
Here I go!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:56.200
Seto, I can already see your future.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:08:59.620
My turn.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.620
You'll summon Vorse Raider in attack position.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.550
I summon Vorse Raider in attack position!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.490
And set a card.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:14.000
I set a card!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.500
I end my turn.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.900
Just as I saw in my vision.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:22.900
It's my turn.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:28.910
If she can predict the future, does that mean Kaiba will definitely lose?

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:32.320
I want to see him lose, but...

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:38.140
It'll ruin my awesome plans to defeat Kaiba myself.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.920
That'll be frustrating.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.170
This is tough.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.140
No need to worry.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.730
Don't worry.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.900
Kaiba won't lose easily.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.600
You think so?

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.120
Against you.

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:58.570
Kaiba, the power of the Millennium Necklace and the other Items is real.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.640
Be careful.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.420
I knew it.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:08.150
Industrial Illusions' data bank can find the core data easier.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.390
Keldo in defense position.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.110
What?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.310
She didn't look at the card that she drew.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:23.140
Did Ishizu see everything that will happen in her vision?

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.270
So she knew what she would draw?

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.300
It's a trick.

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.300
Mai did something similar before.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:36.280
This isn't Mai's aroma tactics.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.010
The wind would blow the scents away.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:43.520
You'll learn that her ability isn't a trick.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:46.770
I activate a spell card.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.260
Dragged Down into the Grave!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.710
Dragged Down into the Grave?

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:58.070
We both choose two cards in our opponents' hands and discard them to the graveyard.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:02.070
Discard Kaiser Glider and Polymerization.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:06.000
She chose my cards without looking.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.560
What an elaborate trick.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.050
Show me your cards!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:20.790
Discard Spell Reproduction and Monster Reborn!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.450
Understood.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.290
I end my turn.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:30.480
How scary.  My sister is using that strategy.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:35.000
The other Marik couldn't defeat that deck.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.640
Only I'm capable of defeating those tactics.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:42.810
Marik...

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:47.560
Actually, to the evil within Marik...

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:54.860
I will win this duel and then bury you in the darkness with my own hands.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:02.600
Your dear brother is confined deep within my heart.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.170
Sis!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.140
My turn!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.520
Vorse Raider attacks!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.000
Destroy Keldo!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.800
Did you see that in your vision?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.530
Marik, just wait.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:42.040
Instead of looking at the future, you should look at your opponent.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.620
You still don't understand.

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:48.600
I've already seen everything that happens in this duel.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.330
I know what you'll play and how you'll lose.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.280
I know all.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:56.980
You're the one who doesn't understand.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:01.020
Your tricks don't work against me.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.260
I'll use the spell card Shrink next turn.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:12.600
I'll halve Vorse Raider's attack points and tribute it to activate Crush Card Virus.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.400
Your deck will be destroyed.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.410
Ishizu's abilities are eerie.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.570
But Kaiba has Obelisk.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.780
He can overwhelm her.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.970
But if Ishizu's powers are real...

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:30.520
The outcome is already decided, no matter how great Kaiba's deck is.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:34.100
I set a card on the field!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.490
I end my turn.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.990
My turn.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.520
Attack me.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:50.470
When your monster attacks, I'll activate Shrink and Crush Card Virus.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.140
I summon Mudora!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:14:01.310
Even the greatest duelist is powerless against my Millennium Necklace.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.320
The outcome is already decided.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:14.370
You'll lose all your life points when you lose Obelisk.

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:17.740
You cannot avoid this fate.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.250
Seto, forgive me.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:29.970
I'm not allowed to look into the future during a duel.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:36.940
But I'm willing to carry this sin and offer my life to the gods in order to save Marik.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.630
I equip Cestus of Dagla on Mudora!

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.600
Mudora gains 500 attack points!

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:59.240
Attack Vorse Raider!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:02.660
I caught you!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.480
I flip over my set cards!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:09.370
Fall into my death trap!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:20.090
He shrunk his own monster and destroyed it with Crush Card Virus.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:27.560
My virus infects my Dark Attribute monster with 1000 or fewer attack points.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.070
Destroying your monster and deck!

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:38.760
That's Kaiba's deck destruction combo!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:43.550
Ishizu's attack destroyed the main monsters in her deck!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:47.290
Did you foresee this strategy, Ishizu?

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:54.290
Your monsters with 1500 or more attack points go to the graveyard!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:55.800
Understood.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.640
Due to the virus combo, she only has weak monsters in her deck.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:13.050
And my virus combo isn't over yet.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.800
I shall activate this.

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:17.650
Swords of Revealing Light!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:30.700
You're just trying to avoid me for three more turns.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.120
I don't need to avoid you.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.300
Swords of Revealing Light is the countdown to your defeat.

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:38.300
What?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:44.310
After three turns, you will draw a card that will seal your defeat.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.820
Stop your nonsense.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:52.080
Without your main cards, you're the one who's closer to defeat.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:56.320
You should pray that you'll draw a good card during these three turns.

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:59.890
I set one card on the field.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.330
I end my turn.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.910
Virus Cannon...

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:11.640
I'll use this to destroy your spell card.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:16.810
Ishizu, I will rip your wings and finish you!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:22.820
Seto Kaiba, you've played into my sister's hands.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.820
All that's left is when she'll activate that card...

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.920
Here I go!  My turn!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:29.660
I draw!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:39.030
I set a card and end my turn.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.680
It's my turn.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.370
I end my turn.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.640
What's wrong?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.310
Can't draw a monster?

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.970
I thought you saw me lose.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.130
It seems reality is very different.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:02.350
Two turns from now, you will draw the card that leads to your defeat.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.940
You can't bluff me!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.050
Listen!

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:16.740
All the cards I draw will lead to your defeat!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:22.320
Kaiba seems confident as usual, but doesn't he seem to be spinning his wheels?

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:26.000
If someone says that she can see your future, it has to affect you.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.900
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.020
I end my turn.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.250
Nice, big brother!

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.530
You're beating her!

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:45.030
Swords of Revealing Light is useless against him.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.850
I end my turn.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.530
One turn left.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:53.100
It's the countdown to your defeat, Ishizu.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:59.270
You couldn't do anything while Swords of Revealing Light was active.

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:01.800
Try showing some effort.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:06.850
Not that it would be effective.

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:08.550
My turn!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:09.650
I draw!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.060
I end my turn.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:14.700
My turn.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.940
Blast Held by a Tribute.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.070
I end my turn.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.330
By ending this turn...

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:27.210
The countdown to your defeat is complete.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:31.570
Nonsense.  All you did was stall for three turns.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:35.580
You couldn't even draw a monster to defend with.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:43.110
Swords of Revealing Light's effect is over!

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.590
Get ready!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.320
I can hear God's pulse from my deck.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:57.500
Did you know that Pegasus created unique rare cards?

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.240
Three God Monsters.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.760
Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.500
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.460
The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:14.820
Whoever acquires all three rare cards will reign at the top of all duelists with an undefeated legend.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:18.120
He will be the King of Kings.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:24.560
I want you to retrieve two stolen God Cards from the Ghouls.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:26.660
And this card.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:28.330
This is...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.700
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:37.540
In order to retrieve the two stolen cards, I entrust this card to you.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:47.550
Giving me Obelisk was a fatal mistake.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.050
I feel it!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:50.540
I draw!

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.760
God is in my hand!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.250
Obelisk...

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:03.510
Des Feral Imp!  Attack her directly!

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:10.400
The future is infinite!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.940
The past is nothing more than a set of footprints!

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:16.970
The past has no meaning for me!

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:21.250
Including the moment when you gave me the God Card, Ishizu!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.490
But God will not lead you to victory.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.480
Listen, Ishizu!

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.370
The future doesn't guide me!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:35.020
The road that I walk on becomes the future!

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:51.200
Kaiba's virus combo eliminated most of Ishizu's main cards.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.350
So why is she so calm?

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:55.820
Huh?  What's that trap card?

00:21:55.820 --> 00:21:58.790
Their decks swapped with their graveyards!

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:04.170
With only six cards left, Kaiba frantically tries to summon Obelisk.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:07.870
Will the future be just as Ishizu predicted?

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:10.870
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Strike That Changes the Future

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.440
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:23.770
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:32.740
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:33.070 --> 00:22:37.710
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:41.680
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:42.110 --> 00:22:49.650
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.650 --> 00:22:53.220
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.990
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.990 --> 00:23:08.100
And walk it without stopping

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:15.710
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:24.680
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.680 --> 00:23:32.660
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:42.500
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
